The authors addressed my main concerns during the rebuttals. I encourage them to incorporate their clarifications and modifications to the raised questions into the revised manuscript, such as:

- limited size of tested models and scalability of the approach;

- inaccuracies and typos in the claims and proofs;

- necessary NTK regime in the theoretical analysis and possible ways to avoid it.

